# Generated by scripts/build-domain-catalogue.mjs at predev/prebuild.
#
# The payload is 1.8 MB of component text served on demand — regenerated by
# every build, so there is nothing to gain from versioning it. The index beside
# it *is* committed: typecheck, lint and test all read it, and requiring a
# prebuild before those would make a clean checkout fail for no good reason.
public/domain-components/
